    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1910 a spur of the San Antonio, Uvalde and Gulf Railroad reached Carrizo Springs, and the town incorporated the same year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
